{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/heroine-idle.gif?t=1747035187\" />\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/jump.gif?t=1747035187\" /> \u3000 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/roboko.gif?t=1747035187\" />  \u3000 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/magician.gif?t=1747035187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2.5D top-down, roguelike shooter set in a base that has been taken over by a revolt of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/kurukuru.gif?t=1747035187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike gameplay, with a different map with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various guns can be picked up in the base. Make use of their features and plan your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no reloading or refilling ammunition. Even if you don't have a gun, you can utilize a beam knife for close quarter combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike twin-stick shooters, your weapon automatically aims at the enemy when within range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're invincible while dashing. Use this to dodge enemy bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire randomly gear from enemies to upgrade the protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save up money to buy guns and gear at the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you fight a boss, you can unlock a practice mode for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are unlockable elements that can be carried over in easy and normal game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In expert mode, there are no carry over elements at all. Use only your skills as a player to break your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is recommended to be played with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/shop.gif?t=1747035187\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/chief.gif?t=1747035187\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2516990?t=1747035187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747035187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747035187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747035187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/heroine-idle.gif?t=1747035187\" />\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/jump.gif?t=1747035187\" /> \u3000 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/roboko.gif?t=1747035187\" />  \u3000 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/magician.gif?t=1747035187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2.5D top-down, roguelike shooter set in a base that has been taken over by a revolt of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/kurukuru.gif?t=1747035187\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike gameplay, with a different map with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various guns can be picked up in the base. Make use of their features and plan your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no reloading or refilling ammunition. Even if you don't have a gun, you can utilize a beam knife for close quarter combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike twin-stick shooters, your weapon automatically aims at the enemy when within range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're invincible while dashing. Use this to dodge enemy bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire randomly gear from enemies to upgrade the protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save up money to buy guns and gear at the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you fight a boss, you can unlock a practice mode for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are unlockable elements that can be carried over in easy and normal game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In expert mode, there are no carry over elements at all. Use only your skills as a player to break your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is recommended to be played with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516990/extras/shop.gif?t=1747035187\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse